span.p:
Allocate memory:
p = malloc(5 * sizeof(int));
// Asks OS for 20 bytes

Handle error!
fprintf(stderr,
'Out of memory!');
return 1;

Use the memory:
p[0] = 10;
p[1] = 20;
// Do work with data

Free the memory:
free(p);
// Returns memory to OS

Set to NULL:
p = NULL;
// Prevents dangling pointer
